{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:44 2026-11-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:44 2026-11-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:44 2026-11-12 HKT</p><p>劉穎鏇、張振朗、劉佩玥拍攝TVB《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕，被安排企前排正中位，三人也曾為劇集在隧道狂跑，但在未通車隧道拍攝則首次，振朗趁機認熟駕駛新路。</p><img alt=\"劉穎鏇人氣急升。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/67b6c558d4fc9cfebdf84830e7fdf151/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"劉穎鏇、張振朗、劉佩玥受力捧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff78387cdc0ed93756b6a4e0b9babb8f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_31_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"劉穎鏇笑容甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/45809da9413df5f211d13384f8f2ffe3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"劉穎鏇、張振朗、劉佩玥拍攝TVB《萬千星輝賀台慶》序幕，被安排企前排正中位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8a3782e2b6271810370748813700a2d6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_32_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"三人在未通車隧道狂跑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/55ccf1813e053ba8987e317de300edf2/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_33_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"劉佩玥努力練舞望不拖後腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/14001e7c501758d58cc2a041acc87eed/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_33.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"三人都企C位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4ea61241908fc6a0ce8afa95bfe020bb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-12_at_20_12_37_1_.jpeg\"/><h2>劉佩玥自認姐姐級跳舞麻麻</h2><p>劉佩玥自覺是姐姐級藝人又跳舞麻麻地，努力練舞望不拖後腿，因大家跳得非常好。振朗如願嘗試體驗《LA LA LAND》舞蹈演出，3小時跳足50次，每日練10小時，望盡力完成。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T14:43:54.710024+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":257,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T13:44:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T01:47:15.897629+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T14:37:27.675941+00:00","content_hash":"5115027ebc8354013f80aabb110e374703bc69f4cbedeac5c1e3faf634b5b60c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":nul